00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:49,518
But there's more to come, Duel fans.

253
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:52,780
I activate my polymerization card,

254
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:57,257
using Witch of the Black Forest and
Lady of Faith together to create

255
00:14:57,340 --> 00:15:03,100
a whole new rock-and-rollin' entity
better known as the Musician King.

256
00:15:05,040 --> 00:15:08,520
How about playing a little
lullaby for Celtic Guardian?

257
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:19,340
No, my Celtic Guardian!

258
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:24,977
I guess your Celtic Guardian wasn't
a big fan of the electric guitar.

259
00:15:25,060 --> 00:15:29,300
I promise the music will be much
more romantic on our date, Taya.

260
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:35,380
I'll just lay this card face down
on the field, ending my turn.

261
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:37,940
Make your move!

262
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,600
Curse of Dragon!

263
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:46,140
Fire your flame and
silence the Musician King!

264
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,900
You fell into my trap!

265
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:51,097
I totally played you! A trap?

266
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:54,920
Time to crank up the
volume with Metal Morph,

267
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:59,198
which transforms Musician King into
the punk rockin' Heavy Metal King.

268
00:16:01,640 --> 00:16:05,680
His attack and defense points
climb up to the top of the charts.

269
00:16:08,980 --> 00:16:11,380
Play the dragon a couple of riffs.

270
00:16:20,300 --> 00:16:21,640
Hmm, how pathetic.

271
00:16:21,900 --> 00:16:24,357
Looks like you're nothing
but a one-hit wonder.

272
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:26,420
Could Johnny actually win?

273
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:30,480
Giant Soldier of Stone in defense mode!

274
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:36,060
You can't really expect that
boulder to stop my Heavy Metal King,

275
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:38,057
especially not with Metal Morph.

276
00:16:38,140 --> 00:16:41,300
It increases his power with every attack.

277
00:16:42,500 --> 00:16:46,760
I think this next song is going
to be just a tremendous smash.

278
00:16:47,340 --> 00:16:48,700
And kick it!

279
00:16:57,260 --> 00:16:59,380
The spirit's in major trouble!

280
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:03,480
Why don't you just give up already, loser?

281
00:17:03,860 --> 00:17:07,580
None of your monsters can
jam with my heavy metal king.

282
00:17:08,900 --> 00:17:11,540
I call forth Dark Magician!

283
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:16,820
Attack, Heavy Metal King!

284
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:20,680
The fun just never ends.

285
00:17:21,020 --> 00:17:22,077
With Metal Morse Effect,

286
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:25,817
Heavy Metal King's attack strength
is greater than Dark Magician's.

287
00:17:25,900 --> 00:17:29,540
Johnny, your ability to
miscalculate is uncanny. Say what?

288
00:17:29,780 --> 00:17:32,015
Your overconfidence renders you blind.

289
00:17:32,340 --> 00:17:33,840
Dark Magic Attack!

290
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:42,837
your heavy metal king has been shattered
impossible because metal morph raises heavy

291
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:47,857
metal king's attack power you're almost
correct johnny but you left out one rule

292
00:17:47,940 --> 00:17:53,317
it's true metal morph increases your attack
power but only when your monster attacks

293
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:56,017
but since my monster attacked heavy metal

294
00:17:56,100 --> 00:17:58,457
king didn't receive
the power bonus leaving

295
00:17:58,540 --> 00:18:03,937
his attack strength less than that of the
dark magician metal morph is a powerful

296
00:18:04,020 --> 00:18:09,877
card when used correctly but maybe you
should have read the instruction manual first

297
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:13,917
i've put an end to your musical mayhem but

298
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:17,577
that just isn't fair you must have cheated

299
00:18:17,660 --> 00:18:23,517
tell me your name just call me yugi wait

300
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:25,894
just a second that name sort of rings a

301
00:18:27,180 --> 00:18:28,220
There's no way.

302
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:31,931
Not the same Yu-Gi who defeated
Pegasus in Duelist Kingdom.

303
00:18:32,020 --> 00:18:33,079
That can't be you.

304
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:35,320
I see that my name struck a chord.

305
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:39,520
It's time to finish this duel,
and it's your move, Johnny.

306
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:42,000
Just forget it.

307
00:18:42,120 --> 00:18:43,414
I can't hang with you.

308
00:18:43,520 --> 00:18:44,420
I'm out, man.

309
00:18:44,520 --> 00:18:46,167
I'm a dancer, not a duelist.

310
00:18:48,220 --> 00:18:51,337
Yu-Gi takes a slight lead
in the duel and you give up?

311
00:18:51,420 --> 00:18:53,717
That's just like when you
tried to cheat and tripped

312
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:56,077
me when I started winning
during the dance battle.

313
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:56,990
Look at you, Johnny.

314
00:18:57,073 --> 00:18:57,937
Where's your pride?

315
00:18:58,020 --> 00:18:59,837
I don't know what you're talking about.

316
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:04,197
When things turn a little bit hairy,
you get scared and start running away.

317
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:05,110
Huh.

318
00:19:05,193 --> 00:19:06,200
And so what if I do?

319
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:09,287
Forfeiting is much better
than facing defeat.

320
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:10,937
Everybody loves a winner.

321
00:19:11,020 --> 00:19:13,196
I can't let people see me as a loser.

322
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:15,986
Tell me, how many friends
do you have, Johnny?

323
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:19,400
I've got tons and tons
of friends. None, right?

324
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,120
One, I think.

325
00:19:21,380 --> 00:19:22,210
One, huh?

326
00:19:22,293 --> 00:19:26,297
Sure about that because that's one friend
more than I would have guessed you had.

327
00:19:26,380 --> 00:19:29,397
Hey, just watch your mouth I don't
have to stay here and take this.

328
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:32,277
I can't stand people who
don't face their problems.

329
00:19:32,360 --> 00:19:33,360
What do you mean?

330
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:36,697
Everybody fails sometimes
But the important

331
00:19:36,780 --> 00:19:38,677
thing is having the
courage to look trouble

332
00:19:38,760 --> 00:19:43,557
straight in the eye If you really want to
be a winner be someone who never gives up.

333
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:46,100
You've got a point guess I was wrong

334
00:19:51,560 --> 00:19:52,390
Hey

335
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:57,120
Taya, thanks for being honest with me

336
00:19:58,740 --> 00:19:59,840
You're welcome

337
00:20:02,940 --> 00:20:07,237
Hopefully now he'll face his problems
instead of running away You're right,

338
00:20:07,320 --> 00:20:09,740
and that's exactly what I have to do

339
00:20:13,660 --> 00:20:14,980
Well, here we are!

340
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:16,219
The Domino Museum!

341
00:20:17,580 --> 00:20:20,580
I think you were right
about this Egyptian exhibit.

342
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:24,740
I feel it may hold clues to the
mysteries of my ancient past.

343
00:20:25,280 --> 00:20:27,240
Answers to some of my questions.

344
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:31,097
Thank you for bringing me here
and for helping me today, Taya.

345
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:32,297
What are friends for?

346
00:20:32,380 --> 00:20:36,120
No matter what's beyond those
doors, I'm ready to face it.

347
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:39,460
We are ready to face it. Let's go!

348
00:20:39,740 --> 00:20:41,720
Okay, I'm right with you.
